<title>NETHERLANDS: BolsWessanen shares up on takeover talk.</title>
<headline>BolsWessanen shares up on takeover talk.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch food and drinks group BolsWessanen added 1.90 guilders to 30.50 in heavy trade on Wednesday on renewed takeover speculation.</p>
<p>&quot;These rumours surface with some regularity, but this time people are naming names,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>She said investors were picking up on talk that British drinks giant Grand Metropolitan was angling for a takeover. Dutch trading group Hagemeyer was also rumoured to be interested in BolsWessanen.</p>
<p>Earlier in the session the shares hit a day-high of 31.10.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
